# ── multer (transitive prod dep via @nestjs/platform-express) ──────────────────────────────────────
# Denial of Service via malformed / deeply-nested / dropped multipart uploads. 0 CRITICAL, no RCE.
# Mitigated: the NestJS API is the internal facade behind edge rate-limiting (PR-011); availability-only.
# FOLLOW-UP: bump multer -> 2.2.0 via an npm override to fully remediate.
CVE-2026-2359
