# ── next (Next.js 14 frontend) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Middleware information disclosure + Server-Side Request Forgery via crafted requests. 0 CRITICAL.
# Fixed only in Next.js 15.5.16 / 16.2.5 (a MAJOR upgrade). Mitigated: tenant isolation, ACL
# deny-by-default, and groundedness are enforced SERVER-SIDE in the API / answer-service, not in Next.
# FOLLOW-UP: Next.js 15 migration (tracked).
CVE-2026-44573
